        <headline>Lake Wind Advisory issued September 24 at 12:09PM PDT until September 25 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Reno NV</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Southwest winds 20 to 30 mph with gusts up to 45 mph.

* WHERE...In California, Mono County. In Nevada, Greater Reno-Carson
City-Minden Area.

* WHEN...From 8 AM to 8 PM PDT Friday.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds and rough waves on area lakes will create
hazardous conditions for small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Check lake conditions before heading out and be prepared for a sudden
increase in winds and wave heights. Consider postponing boating
activities on the lake until a day with less wind.</instruction>
